From 61dfa820b1105f64e460bd3d8a2755e0b75c9586 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PyScotch <pyscotch@noreply.invalid>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:14:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Bugfix: finalize MPI before the PT-Scotch programs exit
 on help and version requests [report R. Perry]

`dggath', `dgmap'/`dgpart', `dgord', `dgscat' and `dgtst' returned
from `main()' without calling `MPI_Finalize()' when invoked with
'?', '-h' or '-V', so that MPI launchers reported the job as having
terminated improperly, with a non-zero exit status, although the
programs had succeeded.

Refs: CLI-21
---
 src/scotch/dggath.c | 7 +++++--
 src/scotch/dgmap.c  | 3 +++
 src/scotch/dgord.c  | 7 +++++--
 src/scotch/dgscat.c | 7 +++++--
 src/scotch/dgtst.c  | 7 +++++--
 5 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/scotch/dggath.c b/src/scotch/dggath.c
